WEBVTT

00:01.080 --> 00:03.080
Thank you for Your Majesty's reward

00:03.320 --> 00:04.680
I don't need anything

00:05.320 --> 00:06.720
Only Xu'er

00:07.120 --> 00:08.640
Has always wanted to ask Your Majesty

00:08.720 --> 00:10.120
For a teacher

00:13.320 --> 00:14.720
Xu'er

00:15.000 --> 00:16.960
Who do you want as your teacher?

00:17.040 --> 00:18.760
Need me to personally ask?

00:20.520 --> 00:21.920
Your son

00:24.240 --> 00:25.760
Your son has always admired Zhu Yuanzhi

00:25.840 --> 00:27.160
Grand General Zhu
